    "GUNSLINGER_GAUNTLET_ITEM_DESC": "<style=cIsDamage>Kill 50%</style> of <style=cIsHealth>all</style> living beings at random. Recharges every <style=cIsUtility>60s</style>.",
    "GUNSLINGER_GAUNTLET_ITEM_PICKUP": "Eliminate half of all life at random.",
    "GUNSLINGER_GAUNTLET_ITEM_LORE": "\"I know what it’s like to lose. To feel so desperately that you’re right, yet to fail nonetheless. It’s frightening, turns the legs to jelly.\"",
