    "GUNSLINGER_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger gets stronger when near hostile entities.               <style=cKeywordName>Wraith Form</style><style=cSub></style>",
    "GUNSLINGER_VENDETTA": "Vendetta",
    "GUNSLINGER_VENDETTA_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger fires Vendetta for 280% damage each bullet, carry up to six bullets, reloads after shooting the last. Every sixth bullet crits for an additional 25% damage.",
    "GUNSLINGER_UNLOAD": "Unload",
    "GUNSLINGER_UNLOAD_DESCRIPTION": "Fire Vendetta for 200% damage. For each successful shot on an enemy, Unload's damage and critical chance are increased, up to +150% damage and 40% critical chance. Missing shots (skybox doesn't count) resets Unload's stacks.",
    "GUNSLINGER_ACCURSEDARM": "Accursed Arm",
    "GUNSLINGER_ACCURSEDARM_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger charges a powerful curse that deals 400% damage, piercing enemies in a line. Enemies hit are weakened.",
    "GUNSLINGER_ORB": "Accursed Orb",
    "GUNSLINGER_ORB_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger casts a powerful curse sphere that shocks nearby enemies for 10% damage and explodes on impact in a wide area for 320% damage. Enemies hit by the explosion are weakened.",
    "GUNSLINGER_WRAITHSTEP": "Wraith Step",
    "GUNSLINGER_WRAITHSTEP_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger dashes for a short distance. Stores up to five charges.",
    "GUNSLINGER_WRAITHFRENZY": "Wraith Frenzy",
    "GUNSLINGER_WRAITHFRENZY_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger enters a frenzy state gaining 50% Movement Speed and 20% LifeSteal. Lasts 3 seconds.",
    "GUNSLINGER_SOULPIERCER": "Soul Piercer",
    "GUNSLINGER_SOULPIERCER_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger fires a burst of Wraith rounds, dealing 180% damage per round. The number of rounds increases with attack speed. Pierces enemies. Deals bonus damage based on enemy health lost.",
    "GUNSLINGER_DEADEYE": "Deadeye",
    "GUNSLINGER_DEADEYE_DESCRIPTION": "Precisely aim for a target. Fire up to 3 powerful bullets that explode on contact, dealing 300% damage in a small area. Enemies hit are slowed down. <style=cKeywordName>Hover</style><style=cSub></style>",
    "GUNSLINGER_DEADEYE_KEYWORD": "<style=cKeywordName>Hover</style><style=cSub> Gunslinger hovers in the air and is immobilized for the duration. While in the air fire 3 bullets in quick succession, dealing 200% damage each.</style>",
    "GUNSLINGER_DEADEYE_PRIMARY": "Deadeye",
    "GUNSLINGER_DEADEYE_PRIMARY_DESCRIPTION": "Gunslinger hovers in the air and precisely aims for a target. Fire up to 3 powerful bullets that explode on contact, dealing 300% damage in a small area. Enemies hit are slowed down.",
